<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Spectrum in deal with AT&amp;T.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Spectrum in deal with AT&amp;T.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spectrum Network Systems Ltd said on Friday it has signed a three year agreement with AT&amp;T's unit AT&amp;T EasyLink Services Australia Ltd for the marketing of AT&amp;T's Internet services to the Spectrum customer base.</p>
<p>Spectrum is a reseller of telecommunications services.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
